<td id="A1.T4.2.4.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right" style="padding-left:4.0pt;padding-right:4.0pt;">42.5%</td>
<td id="A1.T4.2.4.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right" style="padding-left:4.0pt;padding-right:4.0pt;">93933</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T4.2.5" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T4.2.5.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding-left:4.0pt;padding-right:4.0pt;">
<span id="A1.T4.2.5.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A1.T4.2.5.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">If you were to draw a tight box around each object in the image, which type of object would have the biggest box?</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.T4.2.5.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right" style="padding-left:4.0pt;padding-right:4.0pt;">0.02</td>
<td id="A1.T4.2.5.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right" style="padding-left:4.0pt;padding-right:4.0pt;">69.74</td>
<td id="A1.T4.2.5.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right" style="padding-left:4.0pt;padding-right:4.0pt;">78.8%</td>
<td id="A1.T4.2.5.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right" style="padding-left:4.0pt;padding-right:4.0pt;">15593</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T4.2.6" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T4.2.6.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding-left:4.0pt;padding-right:4.0pt;">
<span id="A1.T4.2.6.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A1.T4.2.6.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">Rank the <span id="A1.T4.2.6.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">{k}</span> kinds of objects that appear the largest (by pixel area) in the image from largest to smallest. Provide your answer as a comma-separated list of object names only.</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.T4.2.6.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right" style="padding-left:4.0pt;padding-right:4.0pt;">0.03</td>
<td id="A1.T4.2.6.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right" style="padding-left:4.0pt;padding-right:4.0pt;">72.25</td>
